# Dev-only accessibility test tooling (tests/accessibility/package.json installs
# axe-core locally for Playwright to inject into pages under test - see
# tests/accessibility/test_axe_scans.py's module docstring). Never a runtime
# dependency of the Django app; not shipped anywhere near static/.
# package-lock.json IS committed (pins the exact axe-core version, same
# reproducibility rationale as uv.lock) - only the regenerable node_modules/
# tree is ignored.
tests/accessibility/node_modules/
MEDRELAY_FULL_CONTEXT.md
MEDRELAY_FULL_CONTEXT.pdf
